---
title: Programs
description: "FIRST Robotics Competition for grades 7-12, FIRST LEGO League for younger students, and off-season events, all in Aiken, SC."
permalink: /programs/
---
<section class="pagehead">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Programs</h1>
    <p>One organization, with a place for students at different ages and levels of experience.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="teeth teeth--moss" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <ul class="rows">
      {% for p in programs %}
      <li>
        <div class="split">
          <div class="split__head">
            <h2 id="{{ p.slug }}">{{ p.name }}</h2>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p>{{ p.blurb }}</p>
            <dl style="margin: 1.5rem 0 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: max-content 1fr; gap: 0.5rem 1.5rem;">
              <dt style="font-weight: 700;">Who</dt><dd style="margin: 0;">{{ p.who }}</dd>
              <dt style="font-weight: 700;">When</dt><dd style="margin: 0;">{{ p.when }}</dd>
              <dt style="font-weight: 700;">Where</dt><dd style="margin: 0;">{{ p.where }}</dd>
            </dl>
          </div>
        </div>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--fog2">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>The subteams</h2>
    <p class="soft" style="margin-top: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">On the FRC team, every student works with a subteam.</p>
    <table class="parts">
      <thead>
        <tr><th scope="col">Subteam</th><th scope="col">What students do</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for s in subteams %}
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">{{ s.name }}{% if s.also %}<span class="also">{{ s.also }}</span>{% endif %}</th>
          <td>{{ s.does }}</td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band cta">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Find your place on the team</h2>
    <p>Tell us what you are curious about and we will point you to a subteam.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a class="btn btn--moss" href="{{ '/join/' | url }}">How to join</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
